        "tab_gn9cfL": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Details",
            "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>All our gift boxes also include a gift bag</strong></span><strong>, perfect for gifting and creating an unforgettable moment.</strong></p><p>Our Eternal Bear Gift Box with hidden personalized necklace is a gift that lasts a lifetime. Featuring a real preserved rose that will last forever, this gift is the perfect symbol of eternal love.</p><p>Turn the rose to reveal a handmade necklace personalized with the engravings of your choice.</p><p><strong>Details:</strong><br/></p><ul><li>Certified 316L stainless steel — water-resistant and tarnish-free<br/></li><li>Made with the utmost care</li></ul><p><strong>Engraving:</strong></p><ul><li>Up to 15 characters on each heart</li></ul><p><strong>Quality:</strong></p><ul><li>Hypoallergenic: our jewelry is guaranteed nickel-free, cadmium-free and lead-free.</li><li>Water-resistant and tarnish-free</li><li>2-year warranty</li></ul><p><strong>Dimensions:</strong></p><ul><li>Necklace length: 17.3\" + 2\" extender (44 cm + 5 cm)</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_rrRiJK": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping information",
            "content": "<p>All orders are packed, prepared and shipped within <strong>1 to 3 business days</strong>.</p><p>We offer fast worldwide shipping, and the usual delivery time is <strong>6 to 12 days</strong>. Depending on where you live, your items may arrive a little earlier or later.</p><p>Every order comes with a tracking number, so you can follow your package every step of the way.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
