          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/dfg.png",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Sophie M.",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>I ordered this bear for my daughter's 19th birthday. When she discovered the hidden necklace with her initials... she burst into tears! The rose is gorgeous and the necklace is great quality. Fast shipping, 100% recommend.</p>",
