            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Perfect Valentine's Day gift! The rose is really beautiful and looks delicate, but it's actually sturdy. My boyfriend had 'E♡T Forever' engraved and it's exactly what I was hoping for. I wear it every day.</p>",
