            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>My mom loved it! I gave it to her for Mother's Day with 'Mom ♥' engraved. She put it on her dresser and shows the necklace to all her friends. Very happy with my purchase, thank you Soraya Paris.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
